(7384097, 1159089, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love your subject, I dig the decent composition, but I dislike the blur you applied.</td>', 'I love your subject, I dig the decent composition, but I dislike the blur you applied.', '2015-07-08 04:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384244, 1159153, 59029, '<td valign="top">Holy crap look at the size of the paws on that beastie!</td>', 'Holy crap look at the size of the paws on that beastie!', '2015-07-08 11:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384283, 1159294, 114225, '<td valign="top">That is really quite clever. Did you paint them? I see some green that looks like where paint missed.</td>', 'That is really quite clever. Did you paint them? I see some green that looks like where paint missed.', '2015-07-08 11:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384302, 1159340, 60173, '<td valign="top">Those are Oak, no?</td>', 'Those are Oak, no?', '2015-07-08 12:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384303, 1159290, 60173, '<td valign="top">Those are Oak leaves. It would better fit the challenge if they were Maple.</td>', 'Those are Oak leaves. It would better fit the challenge if they were Maple.', '2015-07-08 12:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384305, 1159294, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like how you''ve created the flag, but I''m not terribly fond of that mint green on the undersides of the leaves.</td>', 'I really like how you''ve created the flag, but I''m not terribly fond of that mint green on the undersides of the leaves.', '2015-07-08 12:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384312, 1159344, 60173, '<td valign="top">The photo does not benefit from the door in the background that is then shown through the maple drop. The photo is out of focus and very grainy with many hot pixels (I count at least 12).</td>', 'The photo does not benefit from the door in the background that is then shown through the maple drop. The photo is out of focus and very grainy with many hot pixels (I count at least 12).', '2015-07-08 12:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384313, 1158989, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2015-07-08 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384314, 1159313, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 2</td>', 'Top 2', '2015-07-08 12:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384315, 1159091, 60173, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, though this seems overexposed on the left and over-processed in general. The shadows appear boosted and muddy with very little clear sharpness.</td>', 'Cute idea, though this seems overexposed on the left and over-processed in general. The shadows appear boosted and muddy with very little clear sharpness.', '2015-07-08 12:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384316, 1159091, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 3</td>', 'Top 3', '2015-07-08 12:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384317, 1159293, 60173, '<td valign="top">I would really like to see detail at the edges that have gone completely black.</td>', 'I would really like to see detail at the edges that have gone completely black.', '2015-07-08 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384320, 1159331, 60173, '<td valign="top">This image is visually appealing. The stripes are throwing me though, because it''s too reminiscent of the US flag. Perhaps if it were just two bold red stripes?</td>', 'This image is visually appealing. The stripes are throwing me though, because it''s too reminiscent of the US flag. Perhaps if it were just two bold red stripes?', '2015-07-08 12:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384321, 1159223, 60173, '<td valign="top">The plant material seems dried and withered, and the main flower is fake. Is the green stuff some sort of turf? What isn''t dead is fake it seems. Overall, it just doesn''t do anything for me visually.</td>', 'The plant material seems dried and withered, and the main flower is fake. Is the green stuff some sort of turf? What isn''t dead is fake it seems. Overall, it just doesn''t do anything for me visually.', '2015-07-08 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384323, 1159099, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like better focus in my firework shots. I bet this was beautiful in person though!</td>', 'I like better focus in my firework shots. I bet this was beautiful in person though!', '2015-07-08 12:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384325, 1159153, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful creature. I wish the lighting were better on the Lynx.</td>', 'Beautiful creature. I wish the lighting were better on the Lynx.', '2015-07-08 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384329, 1159306, 60173, '<td valign="top">Overall, strong photo. Some weird fuzzy/color business on the edges of the flag, what''s up with that? Lots of dust spots too. Clean your sensor, eh?  ;)</td>', 'Overall, strong photo. Some weird fuzzy/color business on the edges of the flag, what''s up with that? Lots of dust spots too. Clean your sensor, eh?  ;)', '2015-07-08 12:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384330, 1159236, 60173, '<td valign="top">Overexposed and too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'Overexposed and too saturated for my taste.', '2015-07-08 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384332, 1159105, 60173, '<td valign="top">Okay, I guess. This would work better in a collection than on its own. Outside of the collection, it just seems like an out of focus photo.</td>', 'Okay, I guess. This would work better in a collection than on its own. Outside of the collection, it just seems like an out of focus photo.', '2015-07-08 12:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384333, 1159334, 60173, '<td valign="top">Yup, those be fireworks. Nice exposure and sharpness.</td>', 'Yup, those be fireworks. Nice exposure and sharpness.', '2015-07-08 12:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384338, 1159313, 60173, '<td valign="top">This does not look anything like the Western Red Lily (Lilium philadelphicum) to me.</td>', 'This does not look anything like the Western Red Lily (Lilium philadelphicum) to me.', '2015-07-08 12:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384340, 1159226, 60173, '<td valign="top">That''s a cute little bugger in the left turn lane.</td>', 'That''s a cute little bugger in the left turn lane.', '2015-07-08 12:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384341, 1159356, 60173, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how "endless" the fields of wildflowers are, but okay!</td>', 'I don''t know how "endless" the fields of wildflowers are, but okay!', '2015-07-08 12:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384342, 1159089, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m cool with the people in the background being fuzzy, but the lady and her horse should be 100% crisp in my opinion. Overall, the image seems a bit flat and in need of separating the lady in the foreground from the background. Also, that car on the left really bothers me.</td>', 'I''m cool with the people in the background being fuzzy, but the lady and her horse should be 100% crisp in my opinion. Overall, the image seems a bit flat and in need of separating the lady in the foreground from the background. Also, that car on the left really bothers me.', '2015-07-08 13:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384344, 1159324, 60173, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the blur. The blur might make sense if this were alcoholic syrup, I guess.</td>', 'I don''t like the blur. The blur might make sense if this were alcoholic syrup, I guess.', '2015-07-08 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384347, 1159228, 60173, '<td valign="top">I might have moved down a few headstones to the one with the vivid red flower to make that more prominent. As your eye moves now, we have an interesting headstone, dull wilted looking flowers, and a bright pop of red at the end. I would have liked to see the red pop at the beginning overlaying the headstone a bit. With that said, I don''t know what the grounds looked like, so maybe you made the best choice.</td>', 'I might have moved down a few headstones to the one with the vivid red flower to make that more prominent. As your eye moves now, we have an interesting headstone, dull wilted looking flowers, and a bright pop of red at the end. I would have liked to see the red pop at the beginning overlaying the headstone a bit. With that said, I don''t know what the grounds looked like, so maybe you made the best choice.', '2015-07-08 13:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384349, 1159061, 60173, '<td valign="top">Are you intending to show a Canadian flag on a sunburned body? I must admit, I didn''t see it the first few times I saw this image. Funny now that I see it, but probably could have been presented in a more obvious way? Also, your title is obviously not doing anything for you.</td>', 'Are you intending to show a Canadian flag on a sunburned body? I must admit, I didn''t see it the first few times I saw this image. Funny now that I see it, but probably could have been presented in a more obvious way? Also, your title is obviously not doing anything for you.', '2015-07-08 13:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384350, 1159209, 60173, '<td valign="top">Can''t say that I really get this image. It just looks like a splash of water, and doesn''t say anything about Canada Day to me.</td>', 'Can''t say that I really get this image. It just looks like a splash of water, and doesn''t say anything about Canada Day to me.', '2015-07-08 13:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384351, 1158989, 60173, '<td valign="top">The blacks are too strong, and the reds are overexposed or something. They''re completely blown out and there is no detail.</td>', 'The blacks are too strong, and the reds are overexposed or something. They''re completely blown out and there is no detail.', '2015-07-08 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384352, 1159019, 60173, '<td valign="top">Nice, clear image. No complaints from me.</td>', 'Nice, clear image. No complaints from me.', '2015-07-08 13:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384354, 1159341, 60173, '<td valign="top">It certainly is a maple leaf. I would like to see more... something. Where''s the story? With no story, I am left to want the details of the leaf to be significantly stronger. Currently, it lacks detail and should consume more of the frame to show those fine details.</td>', 'It certainly is a maple leaf. I would like to see more... something. Where''s the story? With no story, I am left to want the details of the leaf to be significantly stronger. Currently, it lacks detail and should consume more of the frame to show those fine details.', '2015-07-08 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384356, 1159225, 60173, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate this to a point, but I don''t feel it highlights anything about photography. I hope you didn''t create the red and white bars in post.</td>', 'I can appreciate this to a point, but I don''t feel it highlights anything about photography. I hope you didn''t create the red and white bars in post.', '2015-07-08 13:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384357, 1159242, 60173, '<td valign="top">This red Maple leaf looks like it committed a crime and the cops have shown their spotlight on it. Hands up, Maple leaf!</td>', 'This red Maple leaf looks like it committed a crime and the cops have shown their spotlight on it. Hands up, Maple leaf!', '2015-07-08 13:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384360, 1159082, 60173, '<td valign="top">Honestly, something about seeing anyone''s national flag in a trash gives me bad feelings. It feels unpatriotic, no matter which country it is.</td>', 'Honestly, something about seeing anyone''s national flag in a trash gives me bad feelings. It feels unpatriotic, no matter which country it is.', '2015-07-08 13:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384363, 1159286, 60173, '<td valign="top">It certainly is a Maple leaf. I get that there''s a Maple leaf on the Canadian flag, but I don''t understand what story you''re trying to tell me about this Maple leaf. It''s not visually appealing enough (sharpness, detail, etc) to stand on its own; it needs a story.</td>', 'It certainly is a Maple leaf. I get that there''s a Maple leaf on the Canadian flag, but I don''t understand what story you''re trying to tell me about this Maple leaf. It''s not visually appealing enough (sharpness, detail, etc) to stand on its own; it needs a story.', '2015-07-08 13:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384364, 1159280, 138253, '<td valign="top">somebody was much fancier with their leaf than I was ;)<br/>nicely done.</td>', 'somebody was much fancier with their leaf than I was ;)nicely done.', '2015-07-08 13:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384366, 1159134, 60173, '<td valign="top">This seems like something Canadians would do on Canada Day. It looks very peaceful and relaxing. Not fond of the border, but whatever.</td>', 'This seems like something Canadians would do on Canada Day. It looks very peaceful and relaxing. Not fond of the border, but whatever.', '2015-07-08 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384367, 1159082, 138253, '<td valign="top">ahhh, the morning after.<br/>happy to see you cleaned up your stuff, did the rest of the partygoers clean up THEIR share of the mess as well? ;)</td>', 'ahhh, the morning after.happy to see you cleaned up your stuff, did the rest of the partygoers clean up THEIR share of the mess as well? ;)', '2015-07-08 13:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384368, 1159061, 138253, '<td valign="top">can''t tell if pen drawing on a scar, or cute homage tattoo, either way, thanks for entering! :)</td>', 'can''t tell if pen drawing on a scar, or cute homage tattoo, either way, thanks for entering! :)', '2015-07-08 13:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
