(7384375, 1159323, 60173, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but a bit over-processed. I really don''t like how things get muddied when people go for that HDR look. Highlights in the hair have been blown, and there''s some weird haloing going on around the foreground fingers and vest.</td>', 'Not bad, but a bit over-processed. I really don''t like how things get muddied when people go for that HDR look. Highlights in the hair have been blown, and there''s some weird haloing going on around the foreground fingers and vest.', '2015-07-08 13:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7384378, 1159296, 60173, '<td valign="top">It''s a simple image, but I like the color banding. I can''t say that it''s a memorable photo, but I don''t hate it.</td>', 'It''s a simple image, but I like the color banding. I can''t say that it''s a memorable photo, but I don''t hate it.', '2015-07-08 13:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
