(7387903, 1159242, 138253, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I did this intentionally "dark" for 3 reasons: 1) it looked pretty bad in full color with the tone-shifted leaf against the green, 2) you could more easily see the stone under the leaves and it made the image feel more "cobbled together at 11:50pm", and finally 3) because not everything about Canada is bright and cheery, we do have some darkness, and I thought that showing that in this image might be interesting. we are a peace-keeping nation, but that doesn''t mean we can''t kick some ass on the battlefield - we took some critical objectives that others couldn''t in Several wars, and we are the only country to successfully fend off a US invasion on more than 1 separate occasion. ;)  (we actually pushed back and burned down the white house at one point!)</td>', 'Honestly, I did this intentionally "dark" for 3 reasons: 1) it looked pretty bad in full color with the tone-shifted leaf against the green, 2) you could more easily see the stone under the leaves and it made the image feel more "cobbled together at 11:50pm", and finally 3) because not everything about Canada is bright and cheery, we do have some darkness, and I thought that showing that in this image might be interesting. we are a peace-keeping nation, but that doesn''t mean we can''t kick some ass on the battlefield - we took some critical objectives that others couldn''t in Several wars, and we are the only country to successfully fend off a US invasion on more than 1 separate occasion. ;)  (we actually pushed back and burned down the white house at one point!)', '2015-07-16 11:41:01.000000', NULL, 0),
